## Failure modes seen
- `load_with` HTTPError `cudaMalloc failed: out of memory` at high ctx → that's
  the REAL ceiling (KV cache too big), not a bug. Binary search handles it.
- Background job exits 143 with empty log → you `process(wait)`-ed it. Relaunch
  without wait.
- `ollama create` (bake) fails `chtimes ... operation not permitted` → blob
  store on NTFS. Move OLLAMA_MODELS to ext4 (see ollama-model-vram-setup).
